或大学里可能就有。

177
00:09:18,030 --> 00:09:20,470
So they are designed for open bench work
它们是为开放式台面操作而设计的，

178
00:09:20,470 --> 00:09:23,110
and they are not designed to handle pathogens.
并不是为处理病原体而设计的。

179
00:09:23,110 --> 00:09:30,290
They are basically designed for basic teaching and research.
它们基本上是为基础教学和研究设计的。

180
00:09:30,290 --> 00:09:35,290
BSL-2 are designed for usage by primary health services
BSL-2是为初级卫生服务机构使用而设计的，

