00:09:35,650 --> 00:09:38,950
and they have diagnostic services as well and research.
它们也提供诊断服务和研究。

182
00:09:38,950 --> 00:09:40,690
And in this case, you must have
在这种情况下，你必须

183
00:09:40,690 --> 00:09:43,170
your good microbiological techniques in place
落实良好的微生物操作技术，

184
00:09:43,170 --> 00:09:46,810
