来传达生物风险。

187
00:09:52,410 --> 00:09:57,170
In BSL-2, you can upgrade your level of safety
在BSL-2中，你可以通过安装生物安全柜

188
00:09:57,170 --> 00:10:03,020
by installing a biological safety cabinet.
来提升安全水平。

189
00:10:03,020 --> 00:10:07,100
BSL-3 are generally referred to as containment facilities
BSL-3一般被称为防护设施，

190
00:10:07,100 --> 00:10:09,740
and they are basically designed
它们基本上是为

191
00:10:09,740 --> 00:10:11,660
