空气会向外流出，

215
00:11:18,140 --> 00:11:21,300
which protects you from any spills.
从而保护你免受任何溢洒物的影响。

216
00:11:22,420 --> 00:11:26,740
And this use a class three biological safety cabinet
而且这里使用III级生物安全柜，

217
00:11:26,740 --> 00:11:35,550
which is hard ducted into the handling units.
它通过硬管连接到空气处理机组。

218
00:11:35,550 --> 00:11:37,870
You may also come across this designation
你们还可能会遇到带有前缀A的

219
00:11:37,870 --> 00:11:39,410
with a prefix A.
这种名称。

220
00:11:39,410 --> 00:11:43,250
So A refers to animal containment facilities.
A指的是动物防护设施。

221
00:11:43,250 --> 00:11:45,270
And these are generally used in research
它们一般用于

222
00:11:45,270 --> 00:11:47,830
involving rodents,
涉及啮齿类动物、

223
00:11:47,830 --> 00:11:49,230
murine models,
鼠类模型、

224
00:11:49,230 --> 00:11:50,390
simian models,
猿猴模型

225
00:11:50,390 --> 00:11:52,110
as well as other animal models.
以及其他动物模型的研究。

226
00:11:52,110 --> 00:11:54,390
So we have until A, B, S, L, four.
所以我们有从ABSL1一直到ABSL4。

227
00:11:55,870 --> 00:11:57,590
And this may be the case
这种情况可能出现在

228
00:11:57,630 --> 00:12:02,270
where some research facilities intend conducting research
一些研究机构打算开展

229
00:12:02,270 --> 00:12:07,110
involving viruses using murine models or simian models.
使用鼠类模型或猿猴模型的病毒研究时。

230
00:12:07,110 --> 00:12:09,550
Plant containment facilities are designated
植物防护设施的名称

231
00:12:09,550 --> 00:12:11,830
with the prefix BSL1P
带有前缀，从BSL1P

232
00:12:13,830 --> 00:12:15,710
and two BSL4P.
到BSL4P。

233
00:12:17,310 --> 00:12:20,870
And these are generally used for containment of plants
它们一般用于对植物进行防护隔离，

234
00:12:20,870 --> 00:12:25,870
because plants can serve as a potential source of pathogens,
因为植物可能成为病原体的潜在来源，

235
00:12:25,950 --> 00:12:26,950
not to humans,
不是对人类，

236
00:12:26,950 --> 00:12:31,430
but to other plants within the vicinity of the facility.
而是对设施附近的其他植物。

237
00:12:31,430 --> 00:12:34,790
These facilities may also be required in your country
你们国家可能也会要求配备这类设施，

238
00:12:34,790 --> 00:12:39,750
if you are working with genetically modified organisms,
如果你在操作转基因生物，

239
00:12:39,750 --> 00:12:42,570
such as genetically modified plants.
比如转基因植物的话。

240
00:12:42,570 --> 00:12:46,870
Now the designation plus at the end of this,
而名称末尾加上“+”号，

241
00:12:46,870 --> 00:12:48,230
for instance BSL3,
例如BSL3+，

242
00:12:48,230 --> 00:12:52,430
indicates that the BSL containment facility
表示这个BSL防护设施

243
00:12:52,430 --> 00:12:54,510
has incorporated some design element
采纳了BSL4的

244
00:12:55,510 --> 00:12:56,710
from BSL4.
某些设计元素。

245
00:12:56,710 --> 00:13:04,020
So this is actually enhanced BSL3 plus.
所以这实际上是加强型的BSL3+。

246
00:13:04,020 --> 00:13:06,540
We now move on to facility design
现在我们进入设施设计部分，

247
00:13:06,540 --> 00:13:08,900
and I would like to draw your attention
我想请大家注意

248
00:13:08,900 --> 00:13:19,730
