And this is a very short tutorial on double bagging.
这是一个关于双层装袋的很短的教程。

730
00:37:49,120 --> 00:37:51,360
So generally in a biological safety cabinet,
一般在生物安全柜中，

731
00:37:51,360 --> 00:37:56,120
we have our waste container and we have one bag,
我们有一个废物容器，里面有一个袋子，

732
00:37:56,120 --> 00:38:00,780
which is a biosafety bag, which is a polypropylene bag, PPE.
那是生物安全袋，是聚丙烯袋，也就是PP袋。

733
00:38:00,780 --> 00:38:02,060
And we have another bag.
我们还有另一个袋子。

734
00:38:02,060 --> 00:38:04,800
Now you will ask me, why do you need two bags?
你们会问我，为什么需要两个袋子？

735
00:38:04,800 --> 00:38:06,520
One placed inside the other.
一个套在另一个里面。

736
00:38:06,520 --> 00:38:10,680
So the reason is when you place your pipette tips
原因是当你把移液器吸头

737
00:38:10,680 --> 00:38:12,960
and your other waste material here,
和其他废物放进这里时，

738
00:38:12,960 --> 00:38:15,440
there is a likelihood of this bag being punctured
这个袋子有可能被刺破

739
00:38:15,440 --> 00:38:16,960
and compromised.
而失效。

740
00:38:16,960 --> 00:38:20,360
So in this case, you may have a spill in the lab.
这样的话，实验室里就可能发生溢洒。

741
00:38:20,360 --> 00:38:24,200
So generally what we do in a biological safety cabinet,
所以一般在生物安全柜中，我们的做法是，

742
00:38:24,200 --> 00:38:30,860
we shift this entire waste container into the cabinet.
把整个废物容器移进安全柜。

743
00:38:30,860 --> 00:38:33,980
We dispose our waste into this.
我们把废物丢进这里面。

744
00:38:33,980 --> 00:38:38,980
And after completion, we seal it using adhesive tape
完成后，我们用胶带

745
00:38:39,580 --> 00:38:42,260
or using ties as the case may be.
或者视情况用扎带把它封好。

746
00:38:42,260 --> 00:38:45,220
And then we decontaminate the surface using,
然后我们对表面进行去污，

747
00:38:45,240 --> 00:38:47,380
for instance, 70% alcohol.
例如用70%的酒精。

748
00:38:48,660 --> 00:38:52,140
And following this, we discard this in the autoclave.
之后，我们把它放进高压灭菌器处理。

749
00:38:52,140 --> 00:38:55,300
This ensures that there is no spill.
这样可以确保不会发生溢洒。

750
00:38:55,300 --> 00:38:58,160
So double bagging is a very important procedure
所以双层装袋是一项非常重要的操作，

751
00:38:58,160 --> 00:39:04,540
which you must adopt in your laboratory.
你们必须在实验室中采用。

