As I mentioned earlier,
正如我前面提到的，

766
00:39:45,280 --> 00:39:50,280
design of the facility involves analysis of the site
设施设计涉及场地分析，

767
00:39:51,660 --> 00:39:54,440
and your facility should ideally be located
你的设施理想情况下应当选在

768
00:39:54,440 --> 00:39:57,620
