You have your BSL laboratory here.
这里是你的BSL实验室。

774
00:40:13,300 --> 00:40:15,940
This is your air handling units.
这是空气处理机组。

775
00:40:15,940 --> 00:40:20,780
And this is your waste disposal system
这是废物处置系统，

776
00:40:20,780 --> 00:40:24,580
